  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 405.01 Purpose. The practice of nuclear pharmacy is hereby recognized as a specialty of pharmacy practice, regulated by the state board of pharmacy. As such, the following rules are included to address those areas specific or unique to this specialty practice.\n\nSource. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10812, eff 4-18-15",
